# This file configures the repository-root FRONTEND project only. Exclude the
# separate Express backend completely: Vercel treats source files under a
# repository-root `api/` directory as Functions, even though this project's
# build output is static. Including them can exceed the Hobby function limit.
#
# The backend Vercel project has `api/` configured as its Root Directory and
# uses api/vercel.json, so this root-level ignore rule does not remove its files
# from backend deployments.
api/

.env*
.git/
node_modules/
.next/
.vinext/
.wrangler/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
